WEBVTT

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.160
The bright sun!

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.950
Bursting swimsuits!

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:16.450
The blue ocean!

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.870
How can we get the summer
experience with this?

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.700
You had me set it up...

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.330
Well, the rainy season only just ended.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:28.120
Hmm. It's bigger than I thought.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.580
Why are we setting up a pool
in the yard, anyway?

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.870
The public pool is too far away.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.950
You just wanted to unveil
your new swimsuit, didn't you?

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.450
H-Hey.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.870
N-No! No, I didn't!

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.080
T-Tactical retreat!

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.450
Retreat?

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:34.000
"Melons, Teacher, Drunk"

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:39.370
Well, now my clothes are wet.

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:40.450
Huh?

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:45.700
No need to freak out. It's fine.
I'm wearing my swimsuit.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:48.660
That's not the issue...

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.410
Then what is?

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:56.540
I-It's... Never mind.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:00.580
You know, your reaction is way different
than when you saw my swimsuit.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:06.250
Hey, I haven't seen that swimsuit before.
When did you get it?

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.790
Yuri forced me to get this...

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:12.290
Doesn't she look great?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.830
Good for you! It looks great on you.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:16.660
Don't tease me, please.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:19.040
Yuri, you got a new one, too.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.620
I did. What do you think?

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:28.620
But wait. Didn't you buy one
with me recently? That one-piece.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:33.040
I did but... I grew a bit since then.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:38.410
But I had to buy a new one
because I didn't grow enough.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.790
I feel so attacked right now!

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:48.200
It sure is hot. Nearly time for summer break.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.450
Shiina.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.250
You're not getting any funny ideas, are you?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.330
What?

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:58.410
Like getting in the pool. No boys allowed!

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:01.950
Now I get treated as a guy.

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.540
Akkun.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.750
Hmm?

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:09.250
What is it, Miss Caretaker?

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:12.540
I finished with the melons.
Will you bring them out?

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.580
Please put some clothes on!

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:16.250
I'm in a bathing suit.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:23.160
I decided to join in with
the others by wearing a swimsuit.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.080
It's nice and cool.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.080
Akkun?

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:34.620
Your face is flushed. Are you all right?
Do you have heatstroke?

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:37.250
Th-Thank you, but I'm fine!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:41.910
Why don't you put on your swimsuit, too?
It'll help you stay cool.

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:44.410
You have a point...

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:49.580
Oh! If I show off my beach body,
they'll see how manly I...

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.790
I can't be unclothed in front of a lady!

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:56.160
I think that ship has sailed...

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:59.500
Don't worry. It'll be fine!

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:02.790
It'll be fine!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:07.870
Hey. Stop running away.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:10.750
Don't grab on to me in that outfit!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:22.540
Akkun, you aren't going to play in the pool?

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:25.700
I'm not brave enough
to intrude on all of that.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.370
Why don't you try it after they're done?

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:32.660
Play in a plastic pool alone?

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:36.950
What if... we do it together?

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.160
Huh?

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:43.450
E-Even more embarrassing.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.330
Is it really so bad?

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:49.200
The truth is I can hardly believe my luck!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:54.700
A chance to see Miss C-Caretaker
in her swimsuit up close for so long...

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.250
No, it's too much!

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:04.910
Ah! That was just what I needed.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.910
Okay, you can put it away now.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.410
There's her authoritarian streak...

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:16.700
Yeah, I'd definitely be
embarrassed to use this alone...

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.910
Hiyah!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.870
Hey!

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:24.830
Refreshing, isn't it?

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:29.910
You went to all the trouble to set it up.
It'd be a shame to pack it up so soon.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:34.040
Wait, is she looking out for me?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:39.910
True, but at least let me
change into my swimsuit first.

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:42.120
Oh!

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:45.700
You really weren't wearing yours.

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:45.700
Oh, Miss Caretaker.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:47.040
I'm sorry!

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:53.660
Oh, there's Yuri.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.500
What are you taking pi--

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.700
Shh!

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:05.040
I want to get a picture of
a ghost to submit for a TV show.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.830
I submit one every year.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.580
This place is h-h-haunted?!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:15.000
Sorry. I was just kidding.
I didn't think you'd get so frightened.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:21.250
A new camera makes you want to squeeze
the shutter button, even if nothing's there.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.200
It does?

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.120
Yes, it does!

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:33.160
Oh! If I got a new pen, I'd probably start
wanting to copy sutras and stuff with it.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:36.370
Is that what people mean when
they call us the Satori Generation?

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:39.000
What kinds of pictures have you been taking?

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.700
Oh, they're not particularly interesting.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.080
They're... refined...?

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.120
You don't need to try to compliment me.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.950
Oops!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.410
Wh-What was that last one...?

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:02.660
If you found out about it, I'm not sure
I could let you stick around...

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.500
Ahh! I didn't see nothin'!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:07.620
Yuri.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.370
Oh, hey, Sumire.

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:11.410
Is now a good time?

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:14.290
Now, now, not in front of Shiina.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.790
Please! I need the stuff!

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:22.250
All right. Let's cut a deal.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:24.870
This can't be good...

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.870
Take a look at this!

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:36.450
Oh! That's it! You've outdone yourself again.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:36.450
What is she looking at?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:40.120
This month I have something very special.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:44.500
The President pretending to be a pop star
when she thinks no one's looking!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:50.410
P-Please! Things are already tight this month.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:53.000
I guess you'll have to make do, then.

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:59.200
Fine. Wait here.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.160
Thanks for all your business!

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:08.750
You heard, didn't you?
You eavesdropped on us.

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:11.250
It was unavoidable!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:15.410
What a shame. You leave me
no choice but elimination.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:16.620
"Elimination"?!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:22.660
Well, perhaps if you do me
a favor I could let it slide.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.080
H-How can I be of service?

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:28.330
Shiina, you're so obedient and helpful.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.290
I'll let you in on a secret.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:38.450
Isn't this the President's room?

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:42.410
I have here a sordid <i>shojo</i> manga.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:46.160
"Rose-eyed Steroid"
"Hanano Labuko"

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:46.160
First, set it down outside her room.

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:49.120
Then, just sit back and
wait for the trap to spring!

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:52.540
Is the President a wild animal or something?

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.290
"Rose-eyed Steroid"
"Hanano Labuko"

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:12.250
Isn't this like planting a hidden camera?

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:18.250
This is how I observe the President's
weakn--er, natural state.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.040
Did she just say weaknesses?

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:23.160
This is why I need your assistance.

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:30.620
I'd like to observe Ms. Ayaka, too,
but her guard is tight, so progress is slow.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:34.870
If you take the pictures,
you might get better results.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:36.410
But isn't this voyeur--

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:38.370
It's observation of their natural state.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.120
I don't even know what to do...

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:56.000
Let's see. Adjust the focus by holding
the button down. Center the subject...

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.370
She saw me!

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:01.790
Oh, Akkun. Are you taking pictures of me?

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:03.370
N-No, I, uh...

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.160
Make sure you get my good side.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.790
R-Right.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.540
Thank you, Akkun.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:21.120
Give me a copy after you develop them.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:23.500
Develop them? What's that?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.750
Ms. Ayaka is certainly an impressive woman.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.370
I know, right!

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:35.660
But these photos don't quite cut it.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:38.000
I knew it.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.700
Am I going to be eliminated?

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.450
Well...

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.410
You're fine. I was kidding from the start.

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:51.700
R-Really?

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:54.950
It's so hard to tell when you're joking.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:58.620
Oh, my. I don't mean to be taken so seriously.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:02.620
I can make good use of this photo.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:16.370
I only take pictures. I don't appear in them.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:21.200
Good work this semester, everyone.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.000
Yay, summer break!

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:27.040
This will be your first summer
break here, won't it, Akkun?

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:30.370
I'm going to help you enjoy it to the fullest.

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:34.950
That's right. This year I get to spend
the break with Miss Caretaker.

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:39.450
But first, let's finish
all your summer homework!

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:44.160
Starting tomorrow, you'll all take turns
spending a day with me on homework.

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:45.500
So soon?!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:50.500
The President's not going to like this.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:53.000
Okay!

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:53.000
She just accepted it?!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:57.700
Didn't you know?
We do it this way every year here.

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:00.080
First I've heard of it.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:03.500
We're going to start you off first, Akkun.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.500
Th-That means...

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:07.160
Just the two of us!

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:14.830
Bask in that joy while you can.
It won't last long.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.290
See ya later!

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:20.200
We have student council business today.

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:22.160
Well, try not to suffer.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:23.450
Have a good day.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:26.700
Oh, yeah! I better clean my room.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:35.040
Now it's too clean, and she'll think it's weird!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.160
Akkun, are you there?

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:39.290
Miss Caretaker!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:43.540
J-Just a minute!

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:48.080
C-Come in.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.540
"Welcome"

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:56.540
No need to be so tense.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:02.000
We'll start off with your drills,
and then work up to...

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:04.660
Akkun?

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:08.750
Oh, sorry. I was just thinking
how much you look like a teacher.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.120
Just call me "Teacher" today.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.660
Y-Yes, Miss Caretaker.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.910
I think you mean, "Yes, Teacher."

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.500
Y-Yes, Teacher.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:25.000
Here, Teacher, have a cushion!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.620
Thank you.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:29.950
And also some tea.

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:31.910
And here, a fan.

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:37.370
And, uh... What else... what else...

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:39.910
Start your schoolwork, Akkun.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:41.120
Right...

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:57.370
Miss Careta-- Teacher? Are you just watching?
You aren't going to... help me?

00:14:57.370 --> 00:15:02.910
Now, now. If you always rely on others,
you'll be hopeless as an adult.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.750
Oh.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:10.620
But after you do it all on your own,
there'll be a little reward.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:12.410
Reward?

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:15.000
O-Okay! I can handle it!

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:24.410
Oh, right. There's no A/C unit
in your room, is there?

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:25.580
No.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.580
What's wrong?

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.700
I-I can handle it.

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:56.330
Oh, you put your answers in the wrong spot.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:59.160
I did? Where?

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.370
Here.

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:03.450
Oh, I did. Thank you.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.750
Ahh, I can't concentrate!

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:12.580
Um, could we take a break?

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:15.450
But it looks like you aren't done yet.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.000
At this rate, you won't finish
by the end of the day.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.700
You can't rest yet.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.410
Um, bathroom?

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:24.000
I think you can wait a little longer.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:27.370
But I really do have to go.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.870
Focus!

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:41.500
I was so excited to do my
homework with Miss Caretaker.

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.410
Who knew she was so Spartan?

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:47.160
Fight, fight, Akkun!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.790
All done!

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:53.500
Good work.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:57.290
You worked hard all day. Good boy.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:02.250
Wait, I still have to pee!

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:15.500
Teacher. I did all my homework...

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.040
Yes, you did.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.790
Just wait here.

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:26.540
At last, my reward!

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:29.000
Akkun.

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.250
Here you go!

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:39.000
It's not what I expected, but oh, well.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.410
And a little treat for myself.

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.120
This is quite the reward.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:56.700
Good evening.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.040
Oh, Ms. Yatsuho.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:00.790
Why are you dressed like that?

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:04.120
I'm the teacher today.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:07.750
Well, whatever. Here's your juice order.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:10.080
Thank you for bringing it on such a hot day.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:11.790
This is juice?

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:15.540
This is something I import specially.

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:16.910
Really?

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:20.620
I'm planning to have a celebration
when everyone's homework is done.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.160
A celebration?

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.750
And we did just get Akkun's done.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.250
What a good boy!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.620
Oh, and I threw this in as a gift.

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.290
Thank you very much.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.370
My little sister loves this juice.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:43.160
What's your little sister like?

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.160
Let's see...

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:51.200
She's in high school...
she's kind... loves her grandma...

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:55.120
I bet she's a wonderful person,
just like Miss Caretaker.

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.700
...great fighter?

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.370
Fighter?!

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:00.950
Shall we open one up?

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:05.330
You worked so hard today. It'll be our secret.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:09.290
Are you sure? Then I'll open one.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:17.120
Oh! I guess the gift was alcohol.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.410
Sorry.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:23.500
Don't worry. I'll drink this one.
You drink the juice.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:24.910
Okay.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:28.620
Now then. To a fun summer break!

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:28.620
Okay!

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:30.000
Cheers!

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:37.540
I feel so adult.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:39.660
We're home!

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:40.950
Welcome back.

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.250
Thanks.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:48.790
Hey, Shiina! You didn't let
Ayaka d-drink, did you?

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.750
Yuzu, welcome baaaaack!

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:56.160
Ms. Ayaka, calm down!

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:57.290
Hmm?

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.250
That's not the right response!

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:04.700
What happened?

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.950
When Ms. Ayaka gets drunk,
she just starts attacking.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.330
Attacking?!

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:20.660
I'll hold her off. Yuri, take Shiina
and hide until she calms down.

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:23.790
No, Sumire. I can't leave you!

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:24.870
Yuri.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:35.330
President... Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> ... Yuri...

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.620
Should I run?

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:42.450
No! I shouldn't abandon them!
I have to do something!

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:45.660
Oh, it's Akkun.

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:47.370
I failed.

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:55.080
Miss C-Caretaker, this is something
only people who are dating should do.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:59.950
But I love all of you.
Don't you love me, Akkun?

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:02.790
I-I do, but...

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:04.700
Wait, what am I saying?

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:10.500
Please stop! This is something we should
take our time working up to. As a man, I--

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:30.700
Huh? Did I fall asleep at some point?

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:36.250
Sorry. I like to drink, but I'm told
it gets to me right away and I fall asleep.

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:39.200
I don't remember myself.

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:42.370
When you're older,
maybe we can have a drink together.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:49.580
W-Well, if she doesn't remember, I should
be glad she didn't ask what happened.

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:51.540
Akkun.
Yes?

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:56.910
I'll be waiting.

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:01.000
She really doesn't remember, does she?

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:42.000
"High School Girl, Swimsuits, Summer Break"
